; One address per room, 0-105, read by #R$D224 (room number in A, record
; address out in IX). Entry 106 points at #R$8B6F, the end of the room records
; (and the start of the entity index), and is not a room. Room 0 is never
; described or entered: it is where things that are not yet (or no longer) in
; play are kept - the China man starts there, as do the case, 'what happened'
; and the other abstract topics you can TELL people about.
; .
; Trivia: #R$840B is also the load address of the separate 'SHD V2.0' block on
; the tape (see loader_notes).
