; #R$E007. Tested 9 November in the closet (room 9): WEAR OLD MANS DISGUISE,
; then TAKE OFF OLD MANS DISGUISE gives 'The old man takes off the old mans
; disguise.' No stored route wears the old man's disguise (they use the china
; man's).
