; 4:56 and takes the 6:15pm train (script #R$EBF1), reaches platform four at
; 7:31, Kings Cross Road at 7:41, a hansom cab at 7:46, Parliament Street at
; 8:01 and Scotland Yard at 8:06pm (script #R$EA99, which then waits for 10pm;
; #R$EAAD puts him off stage at 10:01pm). The speech is only printed if you are
; in the room: riding the same train and cab and walking EAST into Scotland
; Yard at 8:02pm, you hear 'I am afraid that Basil has eluded us Holmes.' at
