; Action record: remember which cab is meant (RUN at $EBAA, $EBBB)
;
; Addresses named in the title: #R$EBAA, #R$EBBB.
; .
; Puts the direct object's number plus one into plan register #R$9FD6. In the
; cab-hailing sub-script at #R$EBA4, which Lestrade, Phipps, the Major and the
; German agent each run when they take a cab, it names the cab they have just
; hailed.
; .
; Seen in the emulator (9 November, tools/experiments/record_coverage.py over
; the 15 stored routes): the body ran 228 times in 14 of them, run by inspector
; lestrade, phipps, major percival ffoulkes, german agent. Every one of its 5
; instructions was executed (tools/experiments/insn_coverage.py).
;
;  Input:$A034 The cab
; Output:$9FD6 The cab's number plus 1
;        F NZ
c$EBD5 DEFB $07,$00  ; Action record header: flags $07; byte 1 $00
 $EBD7 LD A,($A034)  ; Read #R$A032($A034) in "Game variables" into A - The
                     ; direct object's number plus 1...
 $EBDA INC A         ; Add one to A
 $EBDB LD ($9FD6),A  ; ...goes into plan register #R$9FD6
 $EBDE OR $01        ; Make A non-zero, which clears the zero flag, and hand
                     ; that back to the caller - Succeed
 $EBE0 RET           ; Return to the caller

